  "question": {
    "text": "A number is chosen at random from the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;be the probability that the chosen number is a multiple of 3 or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>. Then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is ____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "214",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>1998</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>666</mn></math></p><p>Multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>1995</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>285</mn></math></p><p>Multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>1995</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>95</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>666</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>95</mn></mrow><mn>2000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>856</mn><mn>2000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>214</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>214</mn></math></p>"
  }
